{"text": "This curve is the Rosetta Stone of enzyme kinetics. Almost every idea you'll meet maps onto it. At low substrate concentration, the rate rises nearly linearly, and the enzyme's performance depends on Kcat over Km. Push higher, and you hit diminishing returns. At high substrate, the enzyme is saturated. Adding more barely changes the rate, and you're at Vmax, which equals Kcat times the enzyme concentration. Km sits at the midpoint of the curve, where velocity is half of Vmax. Read it as how much substrate the enzyme needs to get going, not automatically as a measure of affinity.", "words": [[0.0, 0.22, "This"], [0.22, 0.56, "curve"], [0.56, 0.86, "is"], [0.86, 1.02, "the"], [1.02, 1.44, "Rosetta"], [1.44, 1.82, "Stone"], [1.82, 2.16, "of"], [2.16, 2.58, "enzyme"], [2.58, 3.16, "kinetics."], [3.72, 3.98, "Almost"], [3.98, 4.42, "every"], [4.42, 4.82, "idea"], [4.82, 5.12, "you'll"], [5.12, 5.3, "meet"], [5.3, 5.66, "maps"], [5.66, 6.02, "onto"], [6.02, 6.38, "it."], [6.76, 6.94, "At"], [6.94, 7.16, "low"], [7.16, 7.68, "substrate"], [7.68, 8.38, "concentration,"], [8.86, 9.0, "the"], [9.0, 9.18, "rate"], [9.18, 9.68, "rises"], [9.68, 10.14, "nearly"], [10.14, 10.68, "linearly,"], [11.2, 11.38, "and"], [11.38, 11.52, "the"], [11.52, 12.04, "enzyme's"], [12.04, 12.38, "performance"], [12.38, 12.88, "depends"], [12.88, 13.26, "on"], [13.26, 13.82, "Kcat"], [13.82, 14.2, "over"], [14.2, 14.84, "Km."], [15.34, 15.58, "Push"], [15.58, 15.96, "higher,"], [16.26, 16.34, "and"], [16.34, 16.44, "you"], [16.44, 16.62, "hit"], [16.62, 17.04, "diminishing"], [17.04, 17.6, "returns."], [18.2, 18.36, "At"], [18.36, 18.6, "high"], [18.6, 19.08, "substrate,"], [19.24, 19.3, "the"], [19.3, 19.8, "enzyme"], [19.8, 20.12, "is"], [20.12, 20.68, "saturated."], [21.3, 21.52, "Adding"], [21.52, 21.88, "more"], [21.88, 22.28, "barely"], [22.28, 22.78, "changes"], [22.78, 22.98, "the"], [22.98, 23.26, "rate,"], [23.56, 23.78, "and"], [23.78, 23.96, "you're"], [23.96, 24.08, "at"], [